#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:5
#: 07f893b555624f6f819bf72b7119d8d3
msgid "Tattu Plus DroneCAN Battery"
msgstr "Tattu Plus DroneCAN 电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:11
#: 9b21c8583eb54a259a74fc6da1d69d5e
msgid ""
"Tattu Plus batteries with AS150U connectors support DroneCAN which allows "
"the autopilot to retrieve the battery's total voltage, individual cell "
"voltages, current, temperature and percentage of remaining capacity."
msgstr ""
"带 AS150U 连接器的 Tattu Plus 电池支持 DroneCAN，允许飞控获取电池的总电压、单节电压、电流、温度和剩余容量百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:13
#: 1998a7ee10e944fb92cd92114c2861ba
msgid ""
"The contents of this page were verified using a Tattu Plus 1.0 battery with "
"SKU:TAA16KP12S15C."
msgstr "本页内容已使用 SKU：TAA16KP12S15C 的 Tattu Plus 1.0 电池验证。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:15
#: 7f71b524608e4a5987ac7dd504d1cd20
msgid "Some images courtesy of genstattu.com and 3dxr.co.uk"
msgstr "部分图片由 genstattu.com 和 3dxr.co.uk 提供"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:18
#: d5a979bf7d4c4d989b926a9f86dee590
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:20
#: 749c46d6018a49048a840f9ed0b3cae0
msgid ""
"A female AS150U connector with leads should be used to connect the battery's"
" signal wires to the autopilot's CAN port as shown below."
msgstr "应使用带引线的母头 AS150U 连接器，将电池信号线连接到飞控的 CAN 接口，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:26
#: d8f310836c3549a081f6791a2527afa3
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "使用地面站连接飞控，设置以下参数后重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:28
#: 8578c14768d24845a678db42dc46b903
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` to 1 (First Driver)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` 设置为 1（第一驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:29
#: 269011570b724c639e952089ae262365
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` to 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` 设置为 1（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:30
#: 9bd980a57d2d4c7f8cb1245161c8ee39
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` to 8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为 8（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:33
#: e1402484f2de4e6a9a755f6bb7e401f2
msgid "Connecting Multiple Batteries"
msgstr "连接多个电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:35
#: 66a1c12be18945f8a99b908fc87ba57e
msgid ""
"If more than one Tattu battery is connected, use MP's DroneCAN, MAVLink-CAN1"
" feature or the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI<common-uavcan-gui>` to set each battery's"
" \"battery.id\" field to a unique number (e.g. 1 for the 1st battery, 2 for "
"the 2nd battery)."
msgstr ""
"若连接多个 Tattu 电池，使用 Mission Planner 的 DroneCAN MAVLink-CAN1 功能或 :ref:`DroneCAN"
" GUI<common-uavcan-gui>` 将每个电池的 「battery.id」 字段设置为唯一数字（如第1块电池设为 1，第2块设为 2）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:41
#: 9aacb99e59f0455fbe8a04f5b7cdf765
msgid ""
"On the autopilot, set the appropriate battery serial number parameter to "
"match the above battery.id values"
msgstr "在飞控上设置相应的电池序列号参数以匹配上述 battery.id 值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:43
#: 7efc2cb967d045e79a40e1ed0ed02f49
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to 1"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:44
#: 842950066f9946a78845a2c88973675c
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT2_SERIAL_NUM<BATT2_SERIAL_NUM>` to 2"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BATT2_SERIAL_NUM<BATT2_SERIAL_NUM>` 设置为 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:46
#: a0fba074c9134417a013eeaf58fb5aed
msgid ""
"To more easily see the average voltage and total current of multiple "
"batteries a :ref:`\"Sum of Selected Monitors\" battery monitor <common-"
"power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner>` can be configured."
msgstr ""
"若要更方便地查看多个电池的平均电压和总电流，可配置 :ref:`「所选监测器之和」电池监测器 <common-power-module-"
"configuration-in-mission-planner>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:49
#: e1b6e8a8d3dd440e9cfb2c9d3c53c9ba
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:51
#: 0283e27f83f24a2aa69f566d939f7254
msgid ""
"Once connected the battery voltage, current, percent remaining, etc will be "
"visible in the ground station and recorded in the onboard logs.  The image "
"below shows where the data appears on Mission Planner's status screen."
msgstr ""
"连接后，电池电压、电流、剩余百分比等信息将显示在地面站并记录到板载日志中。下图显示了数据在 Mission Planner 状态界面中的显示位置。"
